    <sys:String x:Key="Str.ToolWindows.Opt.Optimization.Desc">None: no optimization. Basic: removes unreferenced procedures and variables. Full: constant folding, dead code removal, variable merging. Experimental: even more optimization (variable reuse, constant propagation); breaks code in some cases, use Full instead.</sys:String>
