    <sys:String x:Key="Str.ToolWindows.Opt.ShortCircuit.Desc">The right side of AND and OR expressions is not evaluated when the result is already known. (X and Y): if X is false, Y is skipped. (X or Y): if X is true, Y is skipped.</sys:String>
